BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 677.0 Tm (The InfiltratorOS exFAT.so module interprets the Microsoft exFAT disk format, independently) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 660.0 Tm (of the FAT12/16/32 modules. Historical specifications define its on-media requirements; our) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 643.0 Tm (build and test system defines only what the current implementation demonstrably supports.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 614.0 Tm (A valid implementation must not mistake a contiguous exFAT stream for a FAT32 cluster) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 597.0 Tm (chain. It must honour the upcase table, bitmap and entry set checksums, and distinguish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (ordinary exFAT from TexFAT. Installation status of the shared object or kernel adapter is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (not proof of recovery qualification.) Tj ET
